== Quake 2 Western Defense ==

This mod allows you to defend yourself from growing waves of bandits.

to aid your defense, you can use money earned from kills to purchase various
interactable objects.





these objects include:


= Horse =

A horse you can ride around and use as additional armor.


= Brad =

A true friend, willing to take a bullet for you. Brad will stand still,
forcing enemies to move around him


= Bodyguard =

While the power of friendship is strong, a hired gun is stronger. Bodyguards
are bigger and have more health


= Health Kit =

Heals the player to max health


= Armor Kit =

Grants player improved armor
